  "body": "Bring your imagination. Roll up your sleeves. Create your coastal dream.\r\n\r\nSet on an impressive 2,227m² (more or less) freehold waterfront landholding, with approximately 353m² of floor area, this is an extraordinary opportunity for someone with vision, creativity and the ambition to transform a substantial property into their dream coastal residence.\r\n\r\nWith direct water access and a private nature walkway leading to Karaka Bay Beach, the property offers a rare connection to the coastline in one of Auckland's most desirable Eastern Bays locations.\r\n\r\nA brand-new swimming pool has just been installed, providing an exciting starting point for your transformation.\r\n\r\nThis is not a home for someone looking for everything already done. It's for those who can see beyond what's there today, roll up their sleeves and create something truly special.\r\n\r\nRenovate, reimagine and unlock the potential of this remarkable waterfront setting.\r\n\r\nDo you have the vision to make it extraordinary?\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing.",
